  "standing": "SYNTHETIC RepoExecutionGrantV2 records evaluated by security_lifecycle_model_v1.admit_repo_execution_grant (execution principal `repository-code` = workflow display `P-TRUSTED-REPO` = foundation semantic-grant kind `trusted-repository-code`; joined to native AuthorizedExecutionV2 and the workflow securityGrantRef/authorizationRef). Owners may be sealed snapshot members or sealed dependency-closure members (external crates' build scripts / proc-macros); the runner is a sealed tool-closure member (bundled cargo/rustc/linker/test runner) or, for test-runner, a snapshot member; no system fallback. Every effect value must equal the security owner's platform truth table. Admission is OPERATIONAL and precedes any Plan (post-reset review SHOULD-2): no Plan semantic-grant projection is an admission input; the Plan-time join is the separate `execution-projection` model (admit_plan_execution_projection) over the consumed preparation grants, and a test-runner grant (workflow test-execution step, no Plan) is projected by nothing. platformId uses the ONE machine vocabulary shared with S8; display aliases refuse. Expected values were authored by hand from security-and-lifecycle.md S10 before execution (same author, not an independent oracle). No repository code was executed and no confinement is claimed by any case.",
